hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"27","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) [pahad] Hira par chadhe, to [pahad] un samait hilne laga. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Theher ja aye Hira, kyunke tujh par Nabi ya Siddiq ya shaheed ke siwa koi nahin.' Aur us par [us waqt] Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), Abu Bakr, Umar, Usman, Ali, Talhah, Zubair, Sa'd aur Sa'id bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhum) the."
